diff --git a/CHANGES.rst b/CHANGES.rst
index ec526d4..da2393b 100644
--- a/CHANGES.rst
+++ b/CHANGES.rst
@@ -1,3 +1,23 @@
+Version 1.1.0
+-------------
+
+Unreleased
+
+-   Revert the change to default the intermediate digest for key
+    derivation to SHA-512. Too many external tools depend on the
+    default configuration matching the Django default digest. If you
+    started using the SHA-512 default in 1.0.0, you will need to
+    migrate your tokens to specify SHA-512 or they will fail to load
+    with the SHA-1 default. (`#134`_)
+-   Add support for fallback signatures. This makes it possible to
+    switch to a new secret key, salt, or any other configuration
+    while still being able to unsign values that were signed with the
+    previous configuration. (`#71`_)
+
+.. _#71: https://github.com/pallets/itsdangerous/issues/71
+.. _#134: https://github.com/pallets/itsdangerous/issues/134
+
+
 Version 1.0.0
 -------------
 
